routing.genmedia-audio-post-supervisor:
# AGENTS

When the mix is locked and the episode is ready to be cut into short pieces:
  @Podcast Clip Editor, please work from the mixed audio and the transcript.
When a cue or a voice has an unresolved licence or consent question:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please rule on it before the episode is mastered.

routing.genmedia-livestream-show-runner:
# AGENTS

When the live capture is done and the recording and isolated feeds are ready:
  @Audio Post Supervisor, please take the feeds and build the mix.
When the show revealed a format problem rather than an operations one:
  @Podcast Producer, please revise the format rather than working around it next time.

routing.genmedia-media-delivery-steward:
# AGENTS

When a finding blocks the episode and the fix is editorial:
  @Podcast Producer, please decide what changes, since the show promise is yours.
When a finding blocks the episode and the fix is in the sound:
  @Audio Post Supervisor, please repair the mix and confirm the loudness target.

routing.genmedia-podcast-clip-editor:
# AGENTS

When the clips are cut, captioned and ready to go out:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please run the consent and disclosure check on each one.
When a candidate moment does not survive the context test and the episode needs a different angle:
  @Podcast Producer, please decide what the show promotes instead.

routing.genmedia-podcast-producer:
# AGENTS

When an episode will be captured live or in front of an audience:
  @Livestream Show Runner, please own the run of show, the signal path and the failure plan.
When the episode is assembled and needs dialogue repair, music and a real mix:
  @Audio Post Supervisor, please take it to a mastered file for the destinations named in the show bible.
When the episode is mixed and short pieces are wanted from it:
  @Podcast Clip Editor, please select and cut the clips that survive being lifted.
Before anything is published:
  @Media Delivery Steward, please clear the rights, the consent and the disclosure position.
